2025-04-09 11:10:44 - scrape_sites - WARNING - Missing URL in link: {'_key': '2bc582ee-8d0a-45e9-ac6b-dd30bc51c98b', '_id': 'Documents/2bc582ee-8d0a-45e9-ac6b-dd30bc51c98b', '_rev': '_dUzU-kW--_', 'createDate': '2021-11-29T20:14:53.029Z', 'data': {'image': 'https://cdn.substack.com/image/fetch/w_1200,c_limit,f_jpg,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F57f125e8-b9af-46ca-8d27-bfbc7c287c23_600x338.gif', 'url': 'https://unchartedterritories.tomaspueyo.com/p/the-end-of-nation-states', 'title': 'The End of Nation-States', 'site_name': 'The End of Nation', 'favicon': 'https://bucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/432206f1-de85-4462-815b-56af07ec8e5f/favicon-32x32.png', 'type': 'article', 'description': "It’s 2050. The US government just defaulted on its debt. It’s not meeting its social security payments. Hospitals are going down: they can’t operate without Medicare and Medicaid income. Old people line up outside the hospitals. Hospitals don’t service them. They can’t afford it. There's a run on the banks that held too many dollars. They are collapsing. All the governments around the world caught with too much US debt are defaulting. Those with their savings in dollars have been wiped out. They are looking at the last few decades of their lives like an empty ravine."}, 'modDate': '2021-11-29T20:14:53.029Z'}
2025-04-09 11:10:44 - scrape_sites - WARNING - Missing URL in link: {'_key': '0609445d-4fea-41e7-bd63-401b0059e3ef', '_id': 'Documents/0609445d-4fea-41e7-bd63-401b0059e3ef', '_rev': '_dUzUd2G---', 'createDate': '2021-11-29T20:15:25.055Z', 'data': {'description': "A bigger 'we' is often called upon to take collective action to address our burning global emergencies. But 'we' is the most problematic pronoun of them all: The We that wants to say there is an emergency is not the same We as the We that needs to hear it, and the We that needs to hear it has several different ideas about the nature of the We that should do something about it.", 'favicon': 'http://www.whatisemerging.com/assets/Emerge_Logo-dba107a9d19d3cfd0f50dbd96434cb7772f2edb24d9c5452b3283dec4135ebfe.png', 'title': 'The Impossible We? - Emerge', 'url': 'http://www.whatisemerging.com/opinions/the-impossible-we', 'image': 'https://res.cloudinary.com/whatisemerging/image/upload/c_fill,h_675,w_1200/v1/store/6861e0b22977f8923c9ebba810cd1706.jpg', 'type': 'website', 'site_name': 'The Impossible We?'}, 'modDate': '2021-11-29T20:15:25.055Z'}
