2025-04-09 11:10:44 - scrape_sites - WARNING - Missing URL in link: {'_key': '86411e8d-99cb-4bad-ad12-7aa09df07121', '_id': 'Documents/86411e8d-99cb-4bad-ad12-7aa09df07121', '_rev': '_eqm1506--_', 'createDate': '2022-08-23T10:20:39.662Z', 'data': {'imageWidth': 1280, 'articleFavorites': '0', 'description': 'The Green Heart of the Planet, part of the toolbox of TAWFI    - storybeing of 360hub Global / http://360hub.global/  This video is made as one of the first  production by The Amazon Wisdom Transfer Initiative  (TAWFI),  initiated in a collaborative  process of a global networks of teachers and mentors.   The last 60 yeas have been fast acceleration for humanity. Since the launch of the book Silent Spring, by Rachel Carlson (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Silent_Spring) ,  the increased awareness of pollution, survival and our common destiny as inhabitants on Planet Earth, has matured our insights and our collective wisdom.    With the first moonshot in 1969 and the launch of Apollo 17 to the moon,  the beauty of the Pale Blue Dot in the vast universe,  become an inner vision of a place called home for the species called humans. It was  coined by Carl Sagan in his reflections of the photograph\'s significance of seeing the blue planet from the moon.    The collaborative work of TAWFI is both inspired by indigenous cultures, as well as the high-tech work of NASA researchers. This first film is a result of work initiated in 2019, and a response to the urgency of children and youth demand for hope and dreams of a more sustainable future.    - Let us keep the Green Heart living, that is our dreaming! -  Let us keep the Earth spinning, let us keep Nature Winning! This is our new Earthshot - let us do it!"  THE THIRD WAY - The path forward for the Amazon Scientists and entrepreneurs have shown that the Amazon area can deliver much more wealth and well-being with the forest standing. The “Third Way’’ for the Amazon shows that the incredible biodiversity forest can produce foods, fruits, medicines, health care products, agroforestry products, sustainable fisheries and much more generating income several times higher than using it for meat cattle and cattle fodder.  This is the new green footprints we can see from the moon. Let us keep this inner image sacred in our hearts: of the pulsing, green heart of the Amazon.   Reforesting the area lost areas and managing the forests sustainable would not only improve the economy but would also help greatly to restore the hydrocycle over large parts of South-America and reduce climate change because the regenerated and extended forest would draw down enormous amounts of greenhouse gases. The choice is still us but time is running out.   A NEW PARTNERSHHIP  -  #17 in the SDGs  - a partnership with NATURE. What will it be?  A partnership between nature, all local people and the bright minds of our day to create this new sustainable and more fair culture, society and economy or will we let the forest die and invite a catastrophe destroying nature’s biodiversity, mild weather and globally important food baskets?  We are this far in the race between climate sanity and suicide that it calls for extraordinary action. To quote Bill McKibben at the CCC19 video call: ‘’winning slowly against climate change is just another way of saying losing.’’   With these insight, let us do our winning fast!  STOPPING THE TIPPING POINT BY EXPONENTIAL GROWTH AND WISDOM TRANSFER  With the alarming clock of a collapse of the Amazon forest, which is recognized of one of nine existential tipping points in the Earth’s climate system, we react with agility, speed and force. When the Amazon die-back the laws of nature become self-enforcing.  It cannot be stopped by any force. It will heat up a continent, threaten two of the most important food baskets of the world, release as much as 40 ppm of CO2 into the already overburdened atmosphere within decades, making our efforts to cut down emissions futile and speeding up the other eight tipping points.   With the effort of TAWFI our goal is to accelerate  into exponential growth,   and we invited all educational institutions, from childhood to grandparents, to be be part of this global of Peer-to-Peer learning scheme - this is our dream!!!  Please, share this video with family and friends - even your teacher in your school - get in touch with us, and be part of our Global Learning Initiative for a true Global Civic Culture.   To save the Amazon is to save the ourselves  - and the blue planet we call home.   For more information about The Amazon Wisdom Transfer Initiative ( TAWTI), please get in touch with us.    We act with vigorous emergency and with an instinct of love directed as a gift to future generations,  the Blue Planet  - and the living heart of the Amazon.   Rob de Laet & IM Stenseth, and extended family of storytellers  Here is the link to more information.   .... .... ...   Invest in nature  - invest in our accelerated learning and wisdom initiatives.', 'profileUsername': '360HUB Global', 'imageHeight': 720, 'type': 'photo', 'video': 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/tr5DwtDnjGw', 'url': 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tr5DwtDnjGw', 'articleComments': '0', 'articleLikes': '36', 'site_name': 'OUR GREEN HEART', 'articleViews': '690', 'favicon': 'https://www.youtube.com/favicon.ico', 'title': 'OUR GREEN HEART - The Amazon and our future are linked!', 'imageSecureUrl': 'https://i.ytimg.com/vi/tr5DwtDnjGw/maxresdefault.jpg'}, 'modDate': '2022-08-23T10:20:39.662Z'}
