2025-04-09 11:10:44 - scrape_sites - WARNING - Missing URL in link: {'_key': '04272f87-557f-4a56-a34b-4b703f47513a', '_id': 'Documents/04272f87-557f-4a56-a34b-4b703f47513a', '_rev': '_e4mRkH---_', 'createDate': '2022-10-05T21:35:54.510Z', 'data': {'description': 'The information bottleneck can also be viewed as a rate distortion problem, with a distortion function that measures how well Y is predicted from a compressed representation T compared to its direct prediction from X. This interpretation provides a general iterative algorithm for solving the information bottleneck trade-off and calculating the information curve from the distribution p(X,Y).', 'favicon': 'https://en.wikipedia.org/static/favicon/wikipedia.ico', 'url': 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Information_bottleneck_method', 'image': 'https://en.wikipedia.org/static/apple-touch/wikipedia.png', 'title': 'Information bottleneck method - Wikipedia', 'type': 'website', 'site_name': 'Information bottleneck method'}, 'modDate': '2022-10-05T21:35:54.510Z'}
