2025-04-09 11:10:44 - scrape_sites - WARNING - Missing URL in link: {'_key': 'a49d2b85-7f29-4413-b75d-53a7d102ce54', '_id': 'Documents/a49d2b85-7f29-4413-b75d-53a7d102ce54', '_rev': '_f_CJp-C--_', 'createDate': '2022-10-25T21:28:08.448Z', 'data': {'favicon': 'https://www.youtube.com/favicon.ico', 'url': 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zi5-90TnI3Y', 'imageWidth': 1280, 'profileUsername': 'NAV Sweden', 'articleViews': '1866', 'description': 'In a time when deep change is needed globally, Daniel Schmachtenberger and Nora Bateson are often invited into discussions of how to meet the big problems humanity is facing…   This is a rare opportunity to participate in a conversation between them that reaches into the depth of personal experience on the day-to-day level of growing up, and preparing the next generations for a new world.   Both Daniel and Nora were raised in households that approached intergenerational learning in unorthodox ways. Both are engaged in the question of how profound shifts happen— and learning to be in this rapidly changing world. What does this mean in terms of parenting? Or caring for the elders? Or learning to live together?  Stöd föreningen NAV:scen genom att swisha ett bidrag till: 123 612 31 60 Eller bli medlem: https://navsweden.se/medlemskap/', 'articleComments': '9', 'title': '"Learning to be in the world" Dinner&Talk @NAV with Nora Bateson & Daniel Schmachtenberger  HD1080p', 'articleFavorites': '0', 'type': 'photo', 'articleLikes': '67', 'video': 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/zi5-90TnI3Y', 'imageSecureUrl': 'https://i.ytimg.com/vi/zi5-90TnI3Y/maxresdefault.jpg', 'imageHeight': 720, 'site_name': '"Learning to be in the world" Dinner&Talk @NAV with Nora Bateson & Daniel Schmachtenberger  HD1080p'}, 'modDate': '2022-10-25T21:28:08.448Z'}
