2025-04-09 11:10:44 - scrape_sites - WARNING - Missing URL in link: {'_key': 'dd47e4d4-dfdb-4e07-9242-113ff4068d7f', '_id': 'Documents/dd47e4d4-dfdb-4e07-9242-113ff4068d7f', '_rev': '_gQWsvK---_', 'createDate': '2023-07-05T13:12:26.559Z', 'data': {'site_name': 'Interaction Institute for Social Change', 'description': 'Over the past five years or so of supporting self-declared “networks” for change, I have evolved in my understanding of what is new when we call something a network, versus a coalition or collaborative or alliance. \xa0On the surface, much can look the same, and one might also say that coalitions, collaboratives and alliances are... Read More', 'favicon': 'https://interactioninstitute.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/cropped-unnamed2-192x192.webp', 'type': 'article', 'title': 'Thinking Like a Network - Interaction Institute for Social Change', 'image': 'https://interactioninstitute.org/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/brain.jpg', 'url': 'https://interactioninstitute.org/thinking-like-a-network/', 'articlePublishedTime': '2013-12-12T10:59:10+00:00', 'locale': 'en_US'}, 'modDate': '2023-07-05T13:12:26.559Z'}
