2025-04-09 11:10:44 - scrape_sites - WARNING - Missing URL in link: {'_key': '97de5e14-6a7e-4b52-920b-ec7753e783f2', '_id': 'Documents/97de5e14-6a7e-4b52-920b-ec7753e783f2', '_rev': '_gQnhq1---_', 'createDate': '2023-07-06T08:48:44.399Z', 'data': {'type': 'music.song', 'title': 'Redefining Wealth in Web3: Philosophical thoughts with Andy Tudhope', 'url': 'https://open.spotify.com/episode/1tGijwUvzVzAfBwYkZ9AZA', 'site_name': 'Spotify', 'favicon': 'https://open.spotifycdn.com/cdn/images/favicon32.b64ecc03.png', 'image': 'https://i.scdn.co/image/ab6765630000ba8afb218baaf0888eed9d1961c5', 'description': 'Listen to this episode from Finding Common Ground on Spotify. Join us on this philosophically rich journey as host Florian Glatz delves deep into the mind of our guest, Andy Tudhope. Based in Africa and introduced to the world of Web3 by his father in 2011, Andy takes us along his unexpected path from a prospective teacher to a pioneer of Web3, a realm where redefining wealth isn\'t a goal, but a reality.\xa0In this episode, we explore the stark contrast between Andy\'s initial expectations of Web3 and the reality it has evolved into today. We examine the complexities of regulations, particularly highlighting the role of Ethereum and the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) within the crypto ecosystem.\xa0As an African native, Andy holds a passionate and optimistic belief in Africa\'s vital role in advancing the crypto world. He shares his vision of a promising future where Africans craft Web3 solutions tailored specifically for their fellow Africans.\xa0Public goods and the concept of beauty are focal points of our conversation, as we probe into how these abstract ideas impact Andy\'s work. The discussion expands into Andy\'s literary contribution, "The Blue Book," a work he fondly refers to as his "proof of love."\xa0We also explore the Kernel community, a brainchild of Andy built for those intrigued by Web3 and keen to develop their skills. We follow Florian\'s journey of founding the Common Ground-project, reflecting on its beginnings when the hopeful mission to bring a gift to this world led to the formation of \'The Fellowship.\'\xa0Wrapping up the episode, Andy imparts invaluable advice for Web3 novices, providing insights on how to effectively navigate and discover the burgeoning scene. Tune in for a conversation that combines idealistic philosophies, technology, and the concept of beauty in a world teetering on the edge of the digital revolution.\xa000:00:00\xa0Welcome to Finding Common Ground00:00:37 Introduction to the podcast00:01:22 Do you already know Common Ground?00:01:36 What is Web3 for Andy?00:08:11 Expectation vs. Reality00:20:39 Web3 in Africa00:25:12 Public goods00:34:29 The concept of beauty00:43:28 The Blue Book00:51:58 Kernel community01:01:16 Stigmas01:06:55 Tips to discover the Web3-Worlds'}, 'modDate': '2023-07-06T08:48:44.399Z'}
