2025-04-09 11:10:44 - scrape_sites - WARNING - Missing URL in link: {'_key': '5780222f-97d1-40b5-bf8d-99b2870a702d', '_id': 'Documents/5780222f-97d1-40b5-bf8d-99b2870a702d', '_rev': '_iHd7pBO--A', 'data': {'url': 'https://zidedoor.com/', 'site_name': 'Oaklands Church of Entheogenic Plants', 'type': 'site', 'image': 'https://i0.wp.com/zidedoor.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/cropped-cropped-zide-door-v3.png?fit=650%2C200&ssl=1', 'title': 'Oaklands Church of Entheogenic Plants', 'description': 'Zide Door is a Church in Oakland that supports the religious use of Entheogenic Sacraments. We follow a nondenominational interfaith religion, The Church of Ambrosia. All Entheogens are sacred to our faith and our church, however our focus is on Sacramental use of cannabis and mushrooms. We believe that mushrooms sparked the first religious experiences of our species. We also believe that direct mystical and religious experiences are a uniting force that can bring individuals closer to their God, their own soul, and their truest understanding of faith. Zide Door welcomes people of all belief systems and religious backgrounds to deepen their connection and experience with the divine realms through direct experience with them. Read more about our faith and beliefs here.'}, 'modDate': '2024-07-09T14:55:02.708Z', 'createDate': '2024-07-09T14:55:02.708Z'}
