2025-04-09 11:10:44 - scrape_sites - WARNING - Missing URL in link: {'_key': '155df416-2f57-4576-b85a-cffc6ec3faca', '_id': 'Documents/155df416-2f57-4576-b85a-cffc6ec3faca', '_rev': '_iNXZsoO--A', 'data': {'title': 'Damaged Earth Catalog', 'description': 'We are humans and might as well get used to it. So far, remotely done power and glory—as via government, big business, formal education, church—has succeeded to the point where gross profits obscure actual loss. In response to this dilemma and to these losses a realm of intimate, community power is developing—power of communities to conduct their own education, find their own inspiration, shape their own environment, and share their knowledge with others. Practices that aid this process are sought and promoted by the DAMAGED EARTH CATALOG.', 'url': 'https://damaged.bleu255.com/', 'type': 'site', 'site_name': 'Damaged Earth Catalog'}, 'modDate': '2024-07-27T22:42:05.092Z', 'createDate': '2024-07-27T22:42:05.092Z'}
2025-04-09 11:10:44 - scrape_sites - WARNING - Missing URL in link: {'_key': '3d3ade2d-8217-4b1b-a4a1-78b179e7df40', '_id': 'Documents/3d3ade2d-8217-4b1b-a4a1-78b179e7df40', '_rev': '_iNXaCom--A', 'data': {'title': 'Principles', 'description': 'This is the ethical basis that permacomputing builds on. It refers to the permacultural principles of "care for the earth" and "care for people", but can be thought of as the basic axiom for all choices.', 'url': 'https://permacomputing.net/Principles/', 'site_name': 'Principles', 'type': 'site'}, 'modDate': '2024-07-27T22:42:27.625Z', 'createDate': '2024-07-27T22:42:27.625Z'}
2025-04-09 11:10:44 - scrape_sites - WARNING - Missing URL in link: {'_key': 'a79a894b-7279-42f7-8702-ce458215afe5', '_id': 'Documents/a79a894b-7279-42f7-8702-ce458215afe5', '_rev': '_iNmWzEG--_', 'data': {'favicon': 'https://www.isocfoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/cropped-Foundation_Icon-192x192.png', 'image': 'https://www.isocfoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/shutterstock_1419591842-e1632908609836.jpg', 'site_name': 'Internet Society Foundation', 'description': 'The Building Opportunities/Leveraging Technologies (BOLT) Grant Program supports technical and social innovations that promote Internet connectivity.', 'articleModifiedTime': '2024-07-26T16:12:14+00:00', 'type': 'article', 'imageHeight': '395', 'imageType': 'image/jpeg', 'imageWidth': '1000', 'title': 'BOLT Grant Program | Internet Society Foundation', 'url': 'https://www.isocfoundation.org/grant-programme/bolt-grant-program/', 'locale': 'en_US'}, 'modDate': '2024-07-28T16:07:29.633Z', 'createDate': '2024-07-28T16:07:29.633Z'}
